OL,3,AWoman in Cornell University rape case
OL,4,Awas 'failed at every turn', New York
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York Governor Kathy Hochul says the
OL,8,Fwoman at the centre of the Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity rape case was "failed" at
OL,10,F"every turn"
OL,12,FHochul says she is "deeply disturbed"
OL,13,Fby the way the case has been handled -
OL,14,Fand that she will not allow it "to be
OL,15,Fswept under the rug"
OL,17,FShe also announces plans to change
OL,18,Fstate law around consent, saying: "If
OL,19,Fsomeone is too intoxicated to consent
OL,20,Fit should not matter if they chose to
OL,21,Fuse drugs or alcohol"
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
