OL,3,AWoman in Cornell University rape case
OL,4,Awas 'failed at every turn', New York
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe case was reopened after the woman
OL,8,Ffiled a civil lawsuit last month,
OL,9,Falleging she was drugged and raped by
OL,10,Fseven men at a fraternity house in 2024
OL,12,FSpeaking yesterday, Hochul appointed
OL,13,FJames as special prosecutor in the case
OL,14,Fafter she "lost faith" in the local
OL,15,Fprosecutor's ability to oversee the
OL,16,Finvestigation
